      "description": "<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2064-penguin-s-doom-toy-collectables/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Original mod</a> for 3.8 by <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/52435-mrpenguin5292/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">MrPenguin5292</a>; <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2487-penguin-s-doom-toys-for-3-9-x/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">updated version</a> for 3.9 by <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/31440-itsreapergirl/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">ItsReaperGirl</a>. I take no credit for this mod, as even the bundle updates I just ran through the illustrious <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/34125-grooveypenguinx/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">grooveypenguinx’s</a> <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/GrooveypenguinX/WTT-BundleMaster\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Bundle Master</a>. Minimally tested, was able to load assets in game that were otherwise using the default pink missing texture shader.</p>\n<h3><strong>PROOF OF PERMISSION</strong></h3>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/9708-pasted-from-clipboard-png/\" alt=\"9708-pasted-from-clipboard-png\" /></p>\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Mod Description</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>~ Intro ~</strong></p>\n<p>**<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://fbi.cults3d.com/uploaders/33561391/illustration-file/b55a861c-6c90-4b69-a63d-2078809b9b47/16125_doom-eternal-prev.png\" alt=\"16125_doom-eternal-prev.png\" /></p>\n<p>﻿~ ﻿Included in this mod ~**</p>\n<p>26 New Toy / Collectables</p>\n<p>(These must be found in raid!, you can not buy these from traders or the flea market!)</p>\n<p>Found Via</p>\n<p>Dead Scav Bodies</p>\n<p>Duffle Bags</p>\n<p>Jackets</p>\n<p>Drawers</p>\n<p>Toolboxes</p>\n<p>Safes</p>\n<p><em><strong>~ Known Issues ~</strong></em></p>\n<p>None</p>\n<p><strong>~ Screenies ~</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Z2qXLb5/image.webp\" alt=\"image.webp\" /></strong></p>\n<p><strong><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/9NbnPWX/image.webp\" alt=\"image.webp\" /></strong></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">How to Install</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Simply extract Penguin’s-Doom Tots.7z into your SPT game folder.</p>\n<p>DrakiaXYZ’s gif for installing a mod:</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vKRw58b.gif\" alt=\"vKRw58b.gif\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">How To Support Penguin</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/mrpenguin5292\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://ko-fi.com/mrpenguin5292</a></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/MrPenguin5292\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://www.patreon.com/MrPenguin5292</a></p>\n<p>(This is not needed, but it helps keep the train going!)</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Credits</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.gifer.com/D0kf.gif\" alt=\"D0kf.gif\" /></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/25352-tron/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Tron</a>- Helping through all my questions - <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/34125-grooveypenguinx/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">GrooveypenguinX</a>- Framework and tons of help